# NOTE: do NOT add "llm_convos/" here. That folder carries its own
# .gitignore (written by scripts/publish_convos.py) which denies everything
# by default and re-includes individual conversations. Ignoring the whole
# directory here would make those per-file exceptions impossible — git
# cannot re-include a file inside an excluded directory.
